{
    "id":  26714,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "AURIS 6W Bridgelux 4CCT LED Downlight 30° | White \u0026 Black",
    "reference":  "SPB6W-4CCT-91536",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAURIS 6W LED Downlight with EagleRise driver and Bridgelux chip\u003c/strong\u003e and high efficiency of 120 lm/W. It features selectable \u003cstrong\u003e4CCT technology (2200K, 2700K, 3000K and 4000K)\u003c/strong\u003e to adapt the lighting to every setting. \u003cstrong\u003eIts 30° optics\u003c/strong\u003e deliver precise, directed light. Front selectable in white or black, with a \u003cstrong\u003eØ35 mm ceiling cut-out\u003c/strong\u003e and dimensions of Ø43x52.5 mm. Ideal for hotels, retail, homes and decorative and professional LED lighting projects.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003e6W Bridgelux LED Downlight | 4CCT | White or Black\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eAuris 6W LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e is a compact and versatile solution for \u003cstrong\u003edecorative and professional LED lighting\u003c/strong\u003e projects. It features a \u003cstrong\u003eBridgelux chip with an efficiency of 120 lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e, delivering excellent light output with low power consumption. Its compact format makes it easy to integrate into different spaces and architectural styles.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4CCT for maximum versatility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts selectable \u003cstrong\u003e4CCT technology\u003c/strong\u003e lets you choose between \u003cstrong\u003e2200K, 2700K, 3000K and 4000K\u003c/strong\u003e, from warm, cosy light to neutral lighting. This versatility allows a single luminaire to adapt to different settings and project requirements, reducing the need to stock multiple references.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e30° beam angle\u003c/strong\u003e concentrates the light precisely, making it especially suitable for creating defined lighting points, highlighting decorative elements or illuminating specific areas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact design and customisable finish\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe front is available in \u003cstrong\u003eWhite or Black\u003c/strong\u003e, making it easy to integrate into both minimalist interiors and contemporary spaces. Its discreet design provides an elegant finish without compromising light performance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith dimensions of \u003cstrong\u003eØ43 x 52.5 mm\u003c/strong\u003e and a \u003cstrong\u003eØ35 mm ceiling cut-out\u003c/strong\u003e, it is particularly well suited to installations that call for a small luminaire and clean visual integration.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRecommended uses and applications\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHomes and apartments\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHotels and hospitality\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShops and retail\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRestaurants and cafés\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCorridors and common areas\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShop windows and decorative spaces\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInterior design projects\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArchitectural lighting\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn short, the \u003cstrong\u003eAuris 6W LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e combines \u003cstrong\u003e120 lm/W, 4CCT technology, 30° optics and a selectable White/Black front\u003c/strong\u003e in a compact, elegant format. An efficient and flexible solution for projects that demand \u003cstrong\u003elight quality, design and easy integration\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
